        {
          "text": "The penitentiary wasn't just mine anymore. I wasn't solely responsible for it, and I didn't have to deal with it alone",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 907
        }
      ],
      "words": 21
    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "\"No one can hurt me anymore.\" My voice was a little softer. \"No, Angel. You're safe now.\"",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1154
        }
      ],
      "words": 17
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "\"Do you think I could fly out?\" \"River did.\" \"River is better with his wings than I ever was.\"",
