          "pos": 1389
        }
      ],
      "words": 19
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The third time, I shot higher into the air. I was far from steady, but it was second nature to take myself up through th",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2124
        }
      ],
      "words": 33
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I guess that was what it meant to have wings. No one was surprised that I could fly, other than me",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2364
        }
      ],
      "words": 21
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "It was over. The past was finally in the past. Maybe now, I could leave it there",
          "ok": true,
